WEBVTT

00:22:29.769 --> 00:22:32.612
I think about one of the benefits
of strong cultures being

00:22:32.636 --> 00:22:37.001
that leaders don't have to use
incentives or controls

00:22:37.025 --> 00:22:38.238
or punishments

00:22:38.262 --> 00:22:41.222
because people have internalized
what the values and norms are,

00:22:41.246 --> 00:22:44.395
and that means if they see something
that is not being done right,

00:22:44.419 --> 00:22:45.856
or a rule that's being broken,

00:22:45.880 --> 00:22:47.665
or a principle that's being violated,

00:22:47.689 --> 00:22:49.693
they will enforce it themselves.

00:22:49.717 --> 00:22:50.959
And that's the upside.

00:22:50.983 --> 00:22:53.555
The downside is, people
will enforce it themselves,

00:22:53.579 --> 00:22:56.147
and they might not be enforcing
the right principles.

00:22:56.455 --> 00:22:59.821
DF: Yeah, I found myself
in just way too many meetings

00:22:59.845 --> 00:23:03.147
being the person that was willing